AEON Inkling-2-Mini ROCm image manifest
=======================================

This file is copied into the image at /opt/aeon/MANIFEST.

Image purpose
-------------
From-source vLLM ROCm build of the cleanroom Inkling-2-Mini engine,
matching the center venv at ~/inkling/engines/aeon-cleanroom
(TheRock ROCm 10.0.0, torch 2.13.0+rocm10.0.0, Python 3.14, gfx1201).

This is not the older GHCR early-access image
ghcr.io/aeon-7/aeon-vllm-ultimate-rocm:2026-10-06-v0.31.0-x86-early-access
(that one is official vLLM v0.31.0 + ROCm 7.2.3 + two Qwen Python patches).

