Build
-----
From this checkout, once Docker is installed:

  docker buildx bake -f docker/docker-bake-rocm.hcl aeon

Default tag: ghcr.io/aeon-7/aeon-vllm-ultimate-rocm:inkling2-r6
Serve with --network host, --device /dev/kfd, --device /dev/dri,
--group-add video --group-add render, and at most 0.80 gpu-memory-utilization
so each GPU keeps at least 15% VRAM free. Do not stop other serves.

